WEBVTT

00:00.540 --> 00:03.750
<b>1983</b>

00:05.130 --> 00:09.300
<b>IN THE MOUNTAINS OF ORIGON VILLAGE,
IN KITA WARD OF KOBE CITY</b>

02:05.250 --> 02:07.940
<b>1990</b>

02:07.940 --> 02:10.080
<b>Is Hitori in the bath?</b>

02:10.080 --> 02:12.590
<b>Yes, he finally went.</b>

02:13.960 --> 02:16.360
<b>Guess now is the time, then.</b>

02:16.880 --> 02:19.820
<b>Let's talk about you-know-what.</b>

02:20.720 --> 02:23.130
<b><i>The two of us will live as one</i></b>

02:23.130 --> 02:25.300
<b><i>in this home.</i></b>

02:25.300 --> 02:26.290
<b><i>We have to</i></b>

02:26.640 --> 02:28.500
<b><i>carry this through.</i></b>

02:28.500 --> 02:30.460
<b>Though, Dali…</b>

02:30.460 --> 02:32.470
<b>…that old couple</b>

02:32.470 --> 02:35.840
<b>may be stronger than we thought.</b>

02:35.840 --> 02:39.230
<b>To think they're
washing their bodies with this.</b>

02:39.230 --> 02:42.280
<b>We just have to be on our guard, Migi.</b>

02:43.030 --> 02:46.490
<b>Does your skin get more layers every year?</b>

02:46.490 --> 02:49.120
<b>They're in their sixties,
so that's 60 layers…</b>

02:49.830 --> 02:51.310
<b>That must be it.</b>

02:59.170 --> 03:00.510
<b>Hitori.</b>

03:03.550 --> 03:05.830
<b>Are you enjoying the bath?</b>

03:08.850 --> 03:10.180
<b>Oh my.</b>

03:10.180 --> 03:13.020
<b>You're using it so well.</b>

03:14.440 --> 03:17.730
<b>I'll put a pair of pajamas and a towel, okay?</b>

03:17.730 --> 03:18.900
<b>Okay.</b>

03:21.530 --> 03:22.360
<b>Huh?</b>

03:25.740 --> 03:28.160
<b>There are two sets of clothes.</b>

03:32.250 --> 03:34.190
<b>Guess he put out two days' worth.</b>

03:37.800 --> 03:39.460
<b>That was close.</b>

03:39.460 --> 03:41.760
<b>She almost found out there are two of us.</b>

03:43.010 --> 03:45.180
<b>Hey. She mentioned pajamas…</b>

03:50.560 --> 03:53.150
<b>Just wait for your turn tomorrow, Dali.</b>

03:54.060 --> 03:55.720
<b>Huh?</b>

03:55.720 --> 03:57.500
<b>You want a reason to wear pajamas?</b>

03:57.500 --> 03:58.810
<b>Yes.</b>

03:58.810 --> 04:01.470
<b>I didn't wear any at the orphanage.</b>

04:01.470 --> 04:03.020
<b>Well,</b>

04:03.020 --> 04:04.360
<b>maybe because pajamas</b>

04:04.360 --> 04:08.150
<b>are something you wear
when you sleep in your own home.</b>

04:08.150 --> 04:09.400
<b>Your home?</b>

04:09.400 --> 04:10.290
<b>That's right.</b>

04:11.000 --> 04:13.600
<b>This place is your home now, Hitori.</b>

04:13.600 --> 04:16.610
<b>And we are a family.</b>

04:19.670 --> 04:20.960
<b>Okay, all set.</b>

04:21.300 --> 04:24.340
<b>Your hair is so pretty, Hitori.</b>

04:25.010 --> 04:27.000
<b>I hate this hair.</b>

04:27.000 --> 04:28.720
<b>Why?</b>

04:29.080 --> 04:30.630
<b>At the orphanage</b>

04:30.630 --> 04:33.500
<b>everyone said my hair was weird.</b>

04:37.310 --> 04:38.460
<b>Hitori.</b>

04:38.460 --> 04:42.850
<b>Being different from others
is a beautiful thing.</b>

04:42.850 --> 04:45.430
<b>Sardine's name is pretty too.</b>

04:45.430 --> 04:47.120
<b>Right, Sardine?</b>

04:47.910 --> 04:49.320
<b>See?</b>

04:49.320 --> 04:50.070
<b>Besides,</b>

04:50.070 --> 04:52.270
<b>if your hair is weird</b>

04:53.080 --> 04:54.160
<b>then aren't I</b>

04:54.160 --> 04:56.230
<b>the oddest of all?</b>

04:59.210 --> 05:00.950
<b>Then that means</b>

05:00.950 --> 05:02.790
<b>I'm the oddestest!</b>

05:02.790 --> 05:03.710
<b>The oddestest?</b>

05:03.710 --> 05:05.000
<b>The oddestestest.</b>

05:05.000 --> 05:06.780
<b>The oddestestest!</b>

05:09.260 --> 05:11.990
<b>You really looked like
a parent and child, Migi.</b>

05:13.140 --> 05:15.460
<b>Stop saying eerie stuff, Dali.</b>

05:15.460 --> 05:17.970
<b>We need this to be a base, you know.</b>

05:17.970 --> 05:20.850
<b>Somewhere to investigate
the people of this village.</b>

05:20.850 --> 05:23.140
<b>We need to move to the next step.</b>

05:23.140 --> 05:25.470
<b>Yes. Let's head outside.</b>

05:31.330 --> 05:33.140
<b>Hitori.</b>

05:34.790 --> 05:36.490
<b>Do you have a second?</b>

05:36.490 --> 05:39.400
<b>Mom and Dad are going out for a bit.</b>

05:39.400 --> 05:41.670
<b>We have an errand to run.</b>

05:43.380 --> 05:45.250
<b>Really?</b>

05:45.250 --> 05:46.860
<b>Can I come?</b>

05:46.860 --> 05:49.880
<b>Oh, well, uhm…</b>

05:49.880 --> 05:51.170
<b>But Sardine!</b>

05:51.170 --> 05:53.470
<b>Sardine will be lonely if you go.</b>

05:54.560 --> 05:56.090
<b>So Hitori,</b>

05:56.090 --> 05:58.650
<b>can you stay home alone for a little?</b>

05:59.610 --> 06:01.320
<b>Okay.</b>

06:01.860 --> 06:03.780
<b>We'll get going, then.</b>

06:06.860 --> 06:08.260
<b>That was suspicious.</b>

06:09.160 --> 06:11.970
<b>I think they're hiding something from us.</b>

06:13.330 --> 06:14.190
<b>OUR ROOM</b>

06:14.190 --> 06:15.430
<b>In that case…</b>

06:21.670 --> 06:22.820
<b>This is…</b>

06:22.820 --> 06:25.280
<b>…their bedroom.</b>

06:33.720 --> 06:34.600
<b>Migi.</b>

06:44.070 --> 06:46.380
<b>I found something strange.</b>

06:47.240 --> 06:47.980
<b>What is it?</b>

06:47.980 --> 06:50.660
<b>A triangle with three strings.</b>

06:51.570 --> 06:53.300
<b>I think I know, Dali.</b>

06:57.370 --> 06:58.290
<b>Let's do it.</b>

07:06.230 --> 07:09.080
<b>I guess inside the house won't work.</b>

07:09.080 --> 07:10.010
<b>Pffh.</b>

07:15.350 --> 07:16.790
<b>What's with this beast!</b>

07:17.060 --> 07:17.840
<b>Migi.</b>

07:17.840 --> 07:20.660
<b>It wants the cloth.</b>

07:27.780 --> 07:29.230
<b>That pesky animal.</b>

07:29.230 --> 07:30.600
<b>Let's continue.</b>

07:30.600 --> 07:32.470
<b>That room is next.</b>

07:33.070 --> 07:35.240
<b>This must be the old man's room.</b>

07:38.410 --> 07:39.390
<b>INTIMATE WRITINGS</b>

07:39.660 --> 07:45.810
<b><i>Knocking on my heart,</i>
<i>little fists, a work of art,</i>
<i>pummeling my shoulder.</i></b>

07:48.300 --> 07:52.740
<b><i>Pain stakes its own claim,</i>
<i>Yet cannot defame</i>
<i>A ride on my shoulder</i></b>

07:54.220 --> 07:58.490
<b><i>The epitome of glee</i>
<i>Striped pajamas</i>
<i>Hitori</i></b>

07:58.490 --> 07:59.680
<b>Musty and stale,</b>

07:59.680 --> 08:01.090
<b>a back so very frail,</b>

08:01.090 --> 08:02.350
<b>absolute fail.</b>

08:05.940 --> 08:07.810
<b>We haven't really</b>

08:07.810 --> 08:09.400
<b>found anything.</b>

08:12.610 --> 08:14.150
<b>Maybe</b>

08:14.150 --> 08:17.810
<b>this old couple has no secrets.</b>

08:19.830 --> 08:22.000
<b>There's something underneath the picture.</b>

08:22.790 --> 08:23.710
<b>What is it?</b>

08:27.000 --> 08:29.200
<b>I knew it. These two…</b>

08:29.200 --> 08:30.420
<b>are hiding things.</b>

08:37.390 --> 08:39.380
<b>This is the old man.</b>

08:39.380 --> 08:42.270
<b>And this beautiful woman…</b>

08:43.350 --> 08:46.640
<b>It's definitely not the old lady.</b>

08:46.640 --> 08:48.220
<b>Dali. This is…</b>

08:48.220 --> 08:51.100
<b>She must be his lover.</b>

08:51.100 --> 08:52.760
<b>What did you make that face for?</b>

08:53.900 --> 08:55.860
<b>Everyone…</b>

08:55.860 --> 08:57.070
<b>…has secrets.</b>

08:59.910 --> 09:02.430
<b>This is the last room on this floor.</b>

09:05.460 --> 09:06.850
<b>It looks like…</b>

09:07.540 --> 09:08.810
<b>…a closet.</b>

09:09.340 --> 09:11.760
<b>That's why they smell musty.</b>

09:16.970 --> 09:18.630
<b>Dali, wait.</b>

09:18.630 --> 09:20.760
<b>What? Are you scared, Migi?</b>

09:20.760 --> 09:21.910
<b>Of course not.</b>

09:22.560 --> 09:23.770
<b>But that getup of yours…</b>

09:24.310 --> 09:27.020
<b>It's to mask the stench of the clothes.</b>

09:34.650 --> 09:36.910
<b>What is this little room?</b>

09:37.660 --> 09:38.950
<b>Something feels off.</b>

09:39.450 --> 09:40.900
<b>Dali…</b>

09:40.900 --> 09:43.310
<b>There's no air in here.</b>

09:44.450 --> 09:45.660
<b>I need fresh air.</b>

09:49.810 --> 09:52.110
<b>It's human hair.</b>

09:52.750 --> 09:55.040
<b>Why is there human hair in here?</b>

09:55.040 --> 09:57.840
<b>The old lady is always stroking my hair.</b>

09:57.840 --> 10:00.350
<b>Do you think it has
something to do with this?</b>

10:07.190 --> 10:08.500
<b>Stop it!</b>

10:09.120 --> 10:10.970
<b>Beast! Let him go!</b>

10:10.970 --> 10:11.920
<b>Not letting go, huh?</b>

10:14.190 --> 10:15.940
<b>That was a car.</b>

10:15.940 --> 10:17.130
<b>They're back.</b>

10:17.130 --> 10:18.560
<b>Do you think…</b>

10:18.560 --> 10:21.360
<b>it was trying to tell us?</b>

10:21.360 --> 10:22.230
<b>Do you…</b>

10:22.230 --> 10:24.370
<b>want to serve us?</b>

10:30.040 --> 10:31.450
<b>Hurry up, Darling,</b>

10:31.450 --> 10:32.980
<b>before he sees us.</b>

10:33.590 --> 10:35.460
<b>I know, I know.</b>

10:38.880 --> 10:40.390
<b>That's suspicious.</b>

10:53.110 --> 10:54.600
<b>We have to</b>

10:54.600 --> 10:58.190
<b>make sure he doesn't
find out about the welcome party.</b>

10:58.190 --> 10:59.480
<b>A welcome party?</b>

10:59.480 --> 11:00.230
<b>Yes.</b>

11:00.230 --> 11:01.730
<b>He has to cover his eyes</b>

11:01.730 --> 11:03.760
<b>at three o'clock tomorrow.</b>

11:03.760 --> 11:07.030
<b>When I bring this out in front of him</b>

11:07.030 --> 11:09.230
<b>he'll be so surprised.</b>

11:09.230 --> 11:11.960
<b>Makes me want to boogie-woogie.</b>

11:24.140 --> 11:25.590
<b>They'll use that machine</b>

11:25.590 --> 11:27.550
<b>to shave our hair off.</b>

11:27.550 --> 11:28.580
<b>To make wigs…</b>

11:29.520 --> 11:31.680
<b>Hitori's welcome party is actually</b>

11:31.680 --> 11:33.890
<b>a ceremonial scalping.</b>

11:33.890 --> 11:35.290
<b>What a hobby.</b>

11:35.820 --> 11:37.680
<b>I never would've guessed</b>

11:37.680 --> 11:39.420
<b>our hair was what they wanted.</b>

11:42.870 --> 11:44.110
<b>We cannot</b>

11:44.110 --> 11:45.220
<b>allow this to happen.</b>

11:46.030 --> 11:48.180
<b>We have to retaliate.</b>

11:50.160 --> 11:51.070
<b>We will not</b>

11:51.070 --> 11:53.460
<b>be scalped without a fight.</b>

11:54.000 --> 11:55.410
<b><i>Hitori,</i></b>

11:55.410 --> 11:57.940
<b><i>the welcome party is about to start.</i></b>

11:57.940 --> 11:59.750
<b>Are you ready?</b>

11:59.750 --> 12:01.880
<b>Yes, Dad.</b>

12:01.880 --> 12:04.210
<b>Dear, the guests will be here soon.</b>

12:04.210 --> 12:06.590
<b>I can't decide what dress to wear.</b>

12:06.590 --> 12:07.950
<b>This is my favorite, but…</b>

12:07.950 --> 12:10.510
<b>it makes me look fat.</b>

12:10.510 --> 12:12.500
<b>It looks great on you.</b>

12:12.500 --> 12:14.140
<b>Come on,</b>

12:14.140 --> 12:16.770
<b>take this seriously.</b>

12:16.770 --> 12:18.930
<b>Oh, I'm at a loss then.</b>

12:18.930 --> 12:20.560
<b>Black clothes would be great.</b>

12:20.560 --> 12:22.320
<b>Both Dad and Mom.</b>

12:23.110 --> 12:24.260
<b>Hitori.</b>

12:24.260 --> 12:25.900
<b>Black, you say?</b>

12:25.900 --> 12:28.530
<b>Won't it look like
we're going to a funeral?</b>

12:28.530 --> 12:30.890
<b>But if you both wear black,</b>

12:31.160 --> 12:33.420
<b>the whole family will be matching.</b>

12:38.340 --> 12:40.110
<b>Okay, that's good.</b>

12:40.670 --> 12:42.880
<b>That'll teach them…</b>

12:42.880 --> 12:46.390
<b>…what happens if you try to deceive us.</b>

12:47.140 --> 12:49.030
<b>Cheers!</b>

12:49.030 --> 12:51.040
<b>Cheers!</b>

12:52.020 --> 12:54.340
<b>Let us introduce</b>

12:54.340 --> 12:57.000
<b>our son, Hitori Sonoyama.</b>

12:57.000 --> 12:58.600
<b>I'm Hitori.</b>

12:58.600 --> 12:59.880
<b>It's nice to meet you.</b>

13:00.480 --> 13:02.380
<b>Do your best, Dali.</b>

13:03.150 --> 13:05.360
<b>I'm counting on you, Migi.</b>

13:07.240 --> 13:09.640
<b>This is the Ichijo family.</b>

13:09.640 --> 13:12.400
<b>Hello, I'm Reiko Ichijo.</b>

13:12.400 --> 13:14.700
<b>How old are you, Hitori?</b>

13:14.700 --> 13:16.620
<b>I'll be 13 this year.</b>

13:16.620 --> 13:17.790
<b>Oh my.</b>

13:17.790 --> 13:20.460
<b>You're the same age as my Eiji.</b>

13:21.050 --> 13:22.290
<b>I'm Eiji.</b>

13:22.290 --> 13:23.420
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

13:23.420 --> 13:24.360
<b>You too.</b>

13:24.360 --> 13:26.470
<b>This is my little sister, Karen.</b>

13:27.760 --> 13:28.820
<b>Hello.</b>

13:29.390 --> 13:31.220
<b>Where do you go to school?</b>

13:31.220 --> 13:33.370
<b>We're still not sure.</b>

13:33.370 --> 13:37.470
<b>Enrolling him at this time
of year is so bothersome.</b>

13:37.470 --> 13:38.760
<b>In that case</b>

13:38.760 --> 13:40.060
<b>until he enrolls,</b>

13:40.060 --> 13:42.310
<b>you should make him a boy scout.</b>

13:42.310 --> 13:43.760
<b>Oh, Mrs. Tsutsumi.</b>

13:43.760 --> 13:46.300
<b>It's fun to be a scout,</b>

13:46.300 --> 13:47.690
<b>isn't it Maruta?</b>

13:47.690 --> 13:49.980
<b>Flag signaling is awesome.</b>

13:49.980 --> 13:51.190
<b>Putting up tents,</b>

13:51.190 --> 13:52.400
<b>making curry,</b>

13:52.400 --> 13:54.700
<b>tying ropes and flag signaling.</b>

13:54.700 --> 13:56.390
<b>Making fires and picking up trash.</b>

13:56.390 --> 13:59.330
<b>Also, flag signaling is awesome.</b>

14:01.710 --> 14:02.580
<b>U</b>

14:02.580 --> 14:03.710
<b>R</b>

14:03.710 --> 14:04.790
<b>O</b>

14:04.790 --> 14:05.920
<b>D</b>

14:05.920 --> 14:06.780
<b>D</b>

14:06.780 --> 14:09.090
<b>You're so good at it.</b>

14:09.090 --> 14:10.370
<b>What did it mean?</b>

14:11.260 --> 14:13.060
<b>It means 'nice to meet you.'</b>

14:14.520 --> 14:15.580
<b>What's your problem?</b>

14:16.640 --> 14:18.050
<b>Here, candy.</b>

14:18.050 --> 14:20.310
<b>My folks told me to give it to you.</b>

14:20.310 --> 14:22.270
<b>Oh, thanks.</b>

14:22.270 --> 14:22.960
<b>Who're you?</b>

14:23.690 --> 14:24.740
<b>Akiyama.</b>

14:25.400 --> 14:26.860
<b>Do you like birds?</b>

14:27.450 --> 14:28.270
<b>Huh?</b>

14:28.270 --> 14:30.470
<b>I saw the bird house in your yard.</b>

14:30.470 --> 14:32.150
<b>Oh!</b>

14:32.150 --> 14:34.860
<b>Part of my name means 'bird'.</b>

14:34.860 --> 14:36.350
<b>Though I can't fly.</b>

14:38.870 --> 14:39.780
<b>I see.</b>

14:39.780 --> 14:41.740
<b>I would've never guessed.</b>

14:41.740 --> 14:43.580
<b>You went to the orphanage</b>

14:43.580 --> 14:45.370
<b>just two months ago, right?</b>

14:45.370 --> 14:48.710
<b>The procedure went so quickly.</b>

14:48.710 --> 14:51.510
<b>You know, Origon Village
makes a difference.</b>

14:52.180 --> 14:54.210
<b>It's kind of a special area.</b>

14:54.210 --> 14:56.880
<b>They did everything fast for us.</b>

14:56.880 --> 14:57.720
<b>Right, it's so…</b>

14:57.720 --> 14:59.250
<b>Now, Migi.</b>

15:00.480 --> 15:01.940
<b>Okay, Dali.</b>

15:08.900 --> 15:10.230
<b>Shit!</b>

15:10.230 --> 15:12.590
<b>This red wine is super spicy!</b>

15:12.590 --> 15:13.900
<b>Water! Water!</b>

15:13.900 --> 15:15.360
<b>Mom, are you okay?</b>

15:15.360 --> 15:16.740
<b>Here, water.</b>

15:16.740 --> 15:17.560
<b>Thanks.</b>

15:19.540 --> 15:21.330
<b>It's still spicy!</b>

15:21.330 --> 15:22.440
<b>Here, water.</b>

15:23.460 --> 15:25.080
<b>It's still spicy!</b>

15:25.080 --> 15:26.280
<b>Here, water.</b>

15:28.300 --> 15:30.700
<b>Actually, that isn't water.</b>

15:30.700 --> 15:33.010
<b>It's clear liquor.</b>

15:38.770 --> 15:41.040
<b>I won't go easy on you.</b>

15:42.400 --> 15:44.390
<b>Next, right hand on blue.</b>

15:44.390 --> 15:46.550
<b>Dad, come here.</b>

15:48.530 --> 15:50.600
<b>You look great, Dad.</b>

15:50.600 --> 15:52.020
<b>I do?</b>

15:52.020 --> 15:54.430
<b>We used olive oil.</b>

15:55.120 --> 15:58.140
<b>We finished preparing for them to burn.</b>

15:58.140 --> 16:00.160
<b>Now, at three…</b>

16:00.160 --> 16:01.740
<b>When the ceremony starts,</b>

16:01.740 --> 16:06.070
<b>we'll pass the 30 degree heat
from the western window through this…</b>

16:06.670 --> 16:11.530
<b>When it hits those two,
the oil and alcohol will do its job.</b>

16:11.530 --> 16:13.740
<b>Everyone will tremble.</b>

16:14.510 --> 16:16.840
<b>It's spontaneous combustion.</b>

16:16.840 --> 16:19.700
<b>They'll think it's God's punishment.</b>

16:19.700 --> 16:20.970
<b>Alright,</b>

16:20.970 --> 16:23.220
<b>who of us will be the decoy?</b>

16:23.220 --> 16:25.750
<b>-Let me do it, Dali.
-Migi?</b>

16:26.360 --> 16:28.560
<b>I want to experience it up close.</b>

16:28.560 --> 16:32.720
<b>The moment when
their sheep's clothing burns.</b>

16:33.280 --> 16:34.190
<b><i>Migi.</i></b>

16:34.190 --> 16:36.930
<b><i>I'll be as determined as you.</i></b>

16:36.930 --> 16:38.890
<b><i>I'll make sure the sun passes…</i></b>

16:38.890 --> 16:40.280
<b><i>That guy…</i></b>

16:40.280 --> 16:42.120
<b><i>Eiji Ichijo, was it?</i></b>

16:43.170 --> 16:44.490
<b>Sorry.</b>

16:44.490 --> 16:46.560
<b>I was looking for the restroom,</b>

16:46.560 --> 16:48.290
<b>but I got lost.</b>

16:48.290 --> 16:50.080
<b>The bathroom's downstairs.</b>

16:50.080 --> 16:51.300
<b>Thanks.</b>

17:01.810 --> 17:02.510
<b>What is it?</b>

17:02.510 --> 17:03.940
<b>Ah, no.</b>

17:04.980 --> 17:06.960
<b>Your hair is pretty.</b>

17:06.960 --> 17:08.270
<b>See you.</b>

17:11.650 --> 17:13.380
<b>He's creepy.</b>

17:16.320 --> 17:17.400
<b>Everyone,</b>

17:17.400 --> 17:19.760
<b>could you make some room please?</b>

17:20.040 --> 17:21.490
<b>Time for a bingo tournament?</b>

17:21.490 --> 17:23.480
<b>No, cheek-to-cheek dancing!</b>

17:23.480 --> 17:26.980
<b>Please humor us for a moment.</b>

17:26.980 --> 17:29.290
<b>Park it, Hitori.</b>

17:29.290 --> 17:30.440
<b>Okay, Mom.</b>

17:33.130 --> 17:34.150
<b>What is this?</b>

17:35.380 --> 17:36.970
<b>I wonder!</b>

17:38.100 --> 17:39.120
<b><i>It's time.</i></b>

17:39.120 --> 17:41.520
<b><i>The placement of the sun… okay.</i></b>

17:43.890 --> 17:45.370
<b>Oh no!</b>

17:45.890 --> 17:49.040
<b>Migi. The-plan-is-can-cel-led!</b>

17:49.480 --> 17:52.250
<b><i>Oh Sun, make it burn!</i></b>

17:53.360 --> 17:56.970
<b><i>Burn off the mask</i>
<i>that they wear to hide their lies!</i></b>

17:59.410 --> 18:00.610
<b>Hitori.</b>

18:00.610 --> 18:02.390
<b>Take off the blindfold.</b>

18:02.950 --> 18:03.750
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

18:08.580 --> 18:09.790
<b><i>That's weird…</i></b>

18:10.750 --> 18:12.920
<b><i>They're not on fire.</i></b>

18:13.630 --> 18:14.870
<b><i>Why?</i></b>

18:14.870 --> 18:15.880
<b><i>No way…</i></b>

18:16.470 --> 18:19.960
<b><i>Did the plan fail?</i></b>

18:19.960 --> 18:21.840
<b>Hitori.</b>

18:21.840 --> 18:23.540
<b>Take it off.</b>

18:28.480 --> 18:29.980
<b><i>It can't be…</i></b>

18:31.440 --> 18:33.280
<b><i>Damn you…</i></b>

18:35.240 --> 18:36.940
<b>A gift from Mom and Dad</b>

18:36.940 --> 18:39.390
<b>to our precious son!</b>

18:39.990 --> 18:42.600
<b>Thank you for coming to us.</b>

18:44.290 --> 18:46.580
<b>-Congrats!
-Welcome!</b>

18:48.920 --> 18:49.880
<b>Oh…</b>

18:50.330 --> 18:51.370
<b>Huh?</b>

18:51.370 --> 18:53.230
<b>Hitori, are you…</b>

18:53.670 --> 18:55.510
<b>not happy?</b>

19:06.350 --> 19:08.440
<b>Oh, Hitori.</b>

19:09.440 --> 19:11.720
<b>You're so happy about it.</b>

19:11.720 --> 19:13.850
<b>It's a success, my dear.</b>

19:13.850 --> 19:15.550
<b>Oh, Darling.</b>

19:27.580 --> 19:28.450
<b>Hey.</b>

19:28.450 --> 19:30.330
<b>Don't be so mad, Migi.</b>

19:31.830 --> 19:34.290
<b>It was only a tiny fire.</b>

19:34.290 --> 19:35.410
<b>I mean,</b>

19:35.410 --> 19:37.580
<b>You froze like a dimwit.</b>

19:37.580 --> 19:39.550
<b>You'd spoil the act.</b>

19:41.550 --> 19:43.320
<b>Here, as good as new.</b>

19:47.270 --> 19:50.290
<b>I didn't think it'd actually
be a welcome party for Hitori.</b>

19:54.230 --> 19:57.140
<b>Can you believe it?</b>

19:57.140 --> 20:00.030
<b>That beautiful woman was the old lady.</b>

20:00.860 --> 20:02.410
<b>The human body is a mystery.</b>

20:03.990 --> 20:05.650
<b>And those…</b>

20:05.650 --> 20:07.720
<b>were synthetic wigs.</b>

20:08.290 --> 20:10.490
<b>It seems like there are still</b>

20:10.490 --> 20:12.370
<b>many things we don't know.</b>

20:13.000 --> 20:14.120
<b>Mmh…</b>

20:14.120 --> 20:15.190
<b>I…</b>

20:16.090 --> 20:17.940
<b>…had no idea.</b>

20:18.840 --> 20:21.990
<b>What it feels like to be a family…</b>

20:27.260 --> 20:28.620
<b>Dali?</b>

20:29.680 --> 20:31.300
<b>Let's go, Migi.</b>

20:31.300 --> 20:32.180
<b>Dali?</b>

20:32.180 --> 20:33.080
<b>Where to?</b>

20:34.940 --> 20:35.790
<b>You know where.</b>

20:37.070 --> 20:39.280
<b>To see our mother.</b>

22:16.710 --> 22:18.000
<b><i>Seven years ago</i></b>

22:18.460 --> 22:20.020
<b><i>I am certain that</i></b>

22:20.750 --> 22:22.020
<b><i>our mother and we</i></b>

22:22.590 --> 22:24.130
<b><i>lived in Origon Village.</i></b>

22:47.280 --> 22:48.910
<b><i>And our mother</i></b>

22:50.320 --> 22:52.280
<b><i>died in Origon Village.</i></b>

23:03.250 --> 23:05.710
<b>We didn't understand back then.</b>

23:07.420 --> 23:08.740
<b>But now we do.</b>

23:09.510 --> 23:10.510
<b>Our mother…</b>

23:11.010 --> 23:13.450
<b>…was murdered by
someone in Origon Village.</b>

23:13.930 --> 23:16.180
<b>The reason we came here as adoptees</b>

23:16.180 --> 23:18.850
<b>was to find the murderer.</b>

23:20.060 --> 23:21.270
<b>And now…</b>

23:21.770 --> 23:23.190
<b>You know, don't you?</b>

23:23.820 --> 23:26.130
<b>No need to lecture me, Dali.</b>

23:27.400 --> 23:28.590
<b>We'll kill them.</b>

23:29.150 --> 23:30.940
<b>The two of us as</b>

23:30.940 --> 23:32.550
<b>one new person.</b>
